.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::NodeManifoldManager< dim >"Policy of \fBModel\fP class for the management of manifolds that consist of multiplicated nodes\&. 


.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
this class is not copy constructable because only a single instance is needed\&. 

.PP
just storage management for manifolds; no targeted access\&. 
.RE
.PP

